5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Good day to you all. Let us approach this trial with calm hearts and open minds. Trust is a fragile thing, but it is the only bridge to our victory.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,I agree. We must rely on logic and observation rather than emotion. Let us observe each other's behavior carefully.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,George,,I shall do as I always do. I will observe from the sidelines and see who among us reveals their true nature.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Logic is indeed the only way. I will be monitoring the consistency of everyone's statements. Please be precise.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited! I'm gonna find the big bad wolf and save everyone! Hehe, you can't hide from me!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Your enthusiasm is refreshing, Sakura. However, remember that patience is a virtue. The truth often reveals itself to those who wait.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Indeed. Let us not rush into accusations. For now, we should simply get a feel for how everyone communicates.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,George,,"I find the noise a bit distracting, but I will keep my eyes open. I prefer to trust my own judgment.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Sakura, please try to remain focused. Emotional outbursts can cloud judgment and provide an opening for the werewolf to manipulate us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Aww, Asuka is so serious! I'll try my best, but I can't help being excited! Who do you guys think looks the most suspicious?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"It is too early for suspicion, my dear. Let us instead focus on building a foundation of honesty. A positive spirit will guide us.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"I believe we should establish a method for sharing information. If anyone has a role that provides data, how should they reveal it?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,George,,I believe the Seer should wait for the right moment. Revealing oneself too early only makes them a target for the wolf.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I agree with George. A premature reveal is illogical. We should wait until the Seer has enough information to make a definitive claim.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, a secret agent! I love secrets! I'll be the one to protect the Seer if they come out! I'll be a super-shield!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"A noble sentiment, Sakura. Let us all strive to protect one another. I look forward to seeing how our bonds grow through this challenge.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,Then we are in agreement. We will observe for now and wait for the first night's results to guide our discussion tomorrow.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,Very well. I have seen enough for today. I shall reflect on these interactions in silence.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I will also be analyzing the patterns of this conversation. I believe we have a sufficient baseline for now.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Me too! I'm gonna go think of some funny tricks to catch the wolf! Goodnight everyone!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
