33,1,1,talk,Servas,,The sun rises again. I hope you all rested well. Let us face this day with courage and a spirit of cooperation.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I have information. Servas, you are the werewolf. I divined you last night, and the result was clear.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,George,,"That is a very bold claim to make so early, Minako. Are you certain you are the Seer, or are you trying to mislead us?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, if you are the Seer, your timing is efficient. However, a werewolf could also claim to be the Seer to frame a villager.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"What?! Servas is the wolf? No way! He's so nice! Minako, are you sure you didn't make a mistake?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"My dear Minako, it is a tragedy when a misunderstanding occurs. I assure you, my heart is pure and my intentions are for the village.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minako,,I do not make mistakes in my divination. The fact remains: Servas is the werewolf. I suggest we execute him now to end this.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,George,,I find it curious that Minako is so aggressive. It is almost as if she wants to force a vote before we can analyze the situation.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, your response is vague. If you are human, do you have any evidence or a logical counter-argument besides your ""pure heart""?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I don't know who to believe! Servas is too sweet to be a wolf, but Minako sounds so sure! This is like a real detective story!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Logic is a tool, Asuka, but it cannot measure the soul. I can only offer you my word and my lifelong commitment to peace.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Words are the easiest thing for a werewolf to manipulate. The divination is a fact. I am the Seer, and Servas is the enemy.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,George,,"I am inclined to believe that we should be cautious. If we execute a villager based on a lie, we lose a precious ally.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@George, the risk of executing a villager is high, but the risk of leaving a known werewolf is higher. If Minako is the Seer, we must act.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Sakura,,But what if Minako is the wolf and she's just lying? That would be a super mean prank! I don't like mean pranks!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy burden to be accused. I forgive you, Minako, for your error. I hope we can find the true wolf together.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Minako,,Your forgiveness is irrelevant. I am confident in my conviction. I urge everyone to vote for Servas.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,George,,I will cast my vote based on my own judgment. I still feel there is something unsettling about this sudden accusation.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"The evidence is currently a stalemate between a claim and a denial. However, the Seer's role is designed for this exact purpose. I will follow the divination.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm so confused! But if Asuka says so, maybe it's true? I'll vote for Servas, but I'm still sad!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
